# Domain Authority

Use the authoritative document for each domain. Do not invent a universal ranking across domains.

| Domain | Authority |
|--------|-----------|
| Financial methodology | `docs/FINANCIAL_METHODOLOGY.md` |
| Scenario persistence | `docs/SCENARIO_PERSISTENCE.md` |
| Export contract | `docs/EXPORT_CONTRACT.md` (Phase 8.1: field semantics frozen without architectural approval; see phase workflow Export fence) |
| Comparison contract | `docs/COMPARISON_CONTRACT.md` |
| Benchmark and defect status | `TEST_BASELINE.md` |
| Product scope | `docs/APP_SCOPE.md` |
| Security | `docs/SECURITY_MODEL.md` |
| Roles and entitlements | `docs/ROLES_AND_ENTITLEMENTS.md` |
| Copy | `docs/COPY_STANDARD.md` |
| UI | `docs/UI_STANDARD.md`, `docs/PORTAL_UI_STANDARD.md` |
| Phase 8.1 execution | `docs/PHASE8_1_EXECUTION_CHARTER.md`, `docs/PHASE8_1_EPIC_BOUNDARIES.md` |
| Phase 8.1 roadmap | `docs/roadmap/PHASE8.1_PRODUCTION_HARDENING_AND_DECOUPLING_ROADMAP.md` |
| Architecture decisions | `docs/adr/README.md` and accepted `docs/adr/*.md` |
| Billing recovery (Epic 8) | `docs/adr/0009-billing-recovery-guarantee.md`, `docs/billing/EPIC8_BILLING_RECOVERY_INVENTORY.md` |
| Deployment pipeline (Epic 9) | `docs/adr/0014-deployment-pipeline.md`, `docs/deployment/EPIC9_CLOSURE.md` |
| Phase 7B cutover (paused) | `docs/PHASE7B_LIVE_STRIPE_CUTOVER_PLAN.md`, `docs/PHASE7B_LIVE_STRIPE_CUTOVER_CHECKLIST.md` |
| Agentic engineering procedure | `docs/agentic/AGENTIC_ENGINEERING_V1.md` (does not supersede domain/phase authority) |
| Current implemented behavior | Source code and **active tests** |

## Documentation vs implementation

- **Documentation** defines approved **target** behavior.
- **Code and active tests** establish **current implemented** behavior.
- When they conflict, **report the conflict** — do not silently pick one side.
- Label gaps as: documented target, current behavior, or unresolved (needs founder decision).

## Before financial work

Read `docs/FINANCIAL_METHODOLOGY.md` and the relevant DEF-*/BM-* rows in `TEST_BASELINE.md`.

## Before Phase 8.1 work

Read `docs/PHASE8_1_EXECUTION_CHARTER.md` and the authorized epic section in `docs/PHASE8_1_EPIC_BOUNDARIES.md`. Do not implement against a missing required ADR when the change depends on that decision — stop and report.
